  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-03-08T09:45:18.799Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# For Physbones\nAllows physbone components to *properly* be enabled and disabled. If modifying and animating components at runtime is too inefficient, this will allow you to disable the component, animate the property, then re-enable it. This will also help fix the issue of the transform chain retaining their last positioning and stretch values when being disabled, by manually resetting the chain back to its resting position when this property is toggled.\n# For Colliders\nAllows for a quick and simple way to turn colliders on and off, without having to worry about problems with them still being “active” or behaving oddly toward physbones on the avatar.\n# For Contacts\nWould provide a cleaner way of enabling and disabling contacts, and can be toggled in order to make sure it doesnt re-trigger or continue triggering a reciever, or continue being triggered by a sender.",
